{"id":"ics-010","stemHtml":"<p>有下面的 C 代码：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-c\">long a[5] = {10, 20, 30, 40, 50};\nlong *p = a + 2;\nchar *c = (char *)a;\n</code></pre>\n<p>(1) <code>*p</code> 与 <code>*(p + 1)</code> 的值分别是多少？</p>\n<p>(2) <code>p - a</code> 的值是多少？<code>p</code> 与 <code>a</code> 的地址相差多少字节？</p>\n<p>(3) <code>c + 3</code> 指向哪里？<code>*(long *)(c + 8)</code> 的值是多少？</p>\n<p>(4) <code>&amp;a[3]</code> 相对 <code>a</code> 的偏移是多少字节？</p>\n","hintHtml":"<p><code>long</code> 占 8 字节：<code>long *</code> 每加 1 走 8 字节，<code>char *</code> 每加 1 走 1 字节。数组名 <code>a</code> 是首元素地址，<code>a + i</code> 与 <code>&amp;a[i]</code> 等价。</p>\n","solutionHtml":"<p><strong>(1)</strong> <code>a + 2</code> 指向 <code>a[2]</code>，所以 <code>\\*p</code> 是 <code>30</code>；<code>p + 1</code> 指向 <code>a[3]</code>，<code>\\*(p + 1)</code> 是 <code>40</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>(2)</strong> 指针相减得到「相隔多少个元素」，不是字节数：</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p-a=2.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>一个 <code>long</code> 是 8 字节，所以地址相差 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\times8=16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span> 字节。</p>\n<p><strong>(3)</strong> <code>c</code> 是 <code>char *</code>，指向 <code>a</code> 的第 0 个字节；<code>c + 3</code> 指向 <code>a</code> 起始地址之后第 3 个字节（它在 <code>a[0]</code> 这 8 个字节的内部，不是 <code>a[3]</code>）。</p>\n<p><code>c + 8</code> 就是 <code>a</code> 的起始地址加 8 字节，即 <code>a[1]</code> 的地址；把它转成 <code>long *</code> 再解引用，得到</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle mathcolor=\"#cc0000\"><mtext>\\*</mtext></mstyle><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>∗</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>20.</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\*(long *)(c+8)=a[1]=20.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">\\*</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong>(4)</strong> <code>&amp;a[3]</code> 的偏移是</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-display\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn><mtext> 字节</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\times8=24\\ \\text{字节}.</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">字节</span></span><span class=\"mord\">.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>三个问题的共同点：<strong>指针算术按所指类型的大小缩放</strong>。<code>a + 2</code> 是加 16 字节，<code>c + 2</code> 是加 2 字节，数字一样但走的距离不一样。</p>\n","mistakesHtml":"<p>一是把 <code>p - a</code> 算成 16（把字节差当元素差）。二是把 <code>c + 3</code> 当成 <code>a[3]</code> 的地址——<code>c</code> 是 <code>char *</code>，只走了 3 个字节。三是以为 <code>a</code> 有「数组长度」信息，<code>sizeof(a)</code> 才是 40 字节，而 <code>a</code> 本身作为地址只占 8 字节。四是解引用 <code>(long *)(c + 3)</code> 这类未对齐访问——本题故意只让你算 <code>c + 3</code> 的位置，不要去读它，x86-64 上这种访问虽然能跑但属于未对齐访问。</p>\n","answerHtml":"<p>(1) <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span></span></span></span>；(2) <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span>，相差 16 字节；(3) 指向 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"monospace\">a</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\texttt{a}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord texttt\">a</span></span></span></span></span> 起始后第 3 个字节，值为 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span>；(4) 24 字节</p>\n"}